Notes:
- `Alert.alert` with a `destructive` style button is the native cross-platform confirmation pattern (renders a bold red action on iOS, a standard dialog button on Android) — no extra modal library needed.
- Delete is async-aware: a full-screen overlay with `ActivityIndicator` blocks interaction while `onDeleteAccount` resolves, and failures surface via a second `Alert`.
- All interactive rows have `accessibilityRole`/`accessibilityLabel` for screen readers (VoiceOver/TalkBack).
- Styling follows iOS grouped-table conventions, which also reads fine on Android; swap colors/radii if you want a more Material look.
